IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `roc-core`
IMPORT `roc-definitions`
IMPORT `roc1-order-3-time`
IMPORT `roc1-order-2`

-- TESTS for roc1-order-2.l4 (Order 2, overview).  Every expected value is written from the text beside the assertion.
-- Calendar: 5 Nov 2026 is a Thursday; the fixture holidays 11 and 23 Nov 2026 are not statements that they are holidays.

`o 2 test calendar` MEANS `Court calendar` WITH
    `public holidays` IS LIST Date 11 11 2026, Date 23 11 2026

#ASSERT `o 2 r 1(2) an action needs to proceed in precisely the same way as set out in this Order` EQUALS JUST FALSE
