-- The period itself (ruling of 2026-11-05 (a)): trial on Friday 20 Nov, so the period starts on Friday 6 Nov (14 days before, that day inside it; fork F11).
-- the day before the period starts, outside it: JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `o 2 r 9(10) the day falls in the period in which no application may be taken out` (Date 5 11 2026) (Date 20 11 2026) NOTHING `o 2 test calendar` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the first day of the period, and the day of the trial: inside, JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 2 r 9(10) the day falls in the period in which no application may be taken out` (Date 6 11 2026) (Date 20 11 2026) NOTHING `o 2 test calendar` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 2 r 9(10) the day falls in the period in which no application may be taken out` (Date 20 11 2026) (Date 20 11 2026) NOTHING `o 2 test calendar` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the Court decided on Tuesday 24 Nov: that day is the last day inside the period; Wednesday 25 Nov is outside it
